      "side": 1,
      "message": "you have an atomicity problem on kb_fifo_entries.\nyou can have the following sequence :\n---\u003e matrix scan event (add one entry)\nKEYSCAN: read kb_fifo_entries  \u003d\u003e N\n----\u003e reading coming from host (remove one entry)\nHOSTCMD: read kb_fifo_entries  \u003d\u003e N\nHOSTCMD: write kb_fifo_entries  \u003d\u003e N-1\nKEYSCAN: write kb_fifo_entries  \u003d\u003e N+1\n\u003d\u003e kb_fifo_entries is N+1 instead of N\n\nyou can use :\natomic_add(\u0026kb_fifo_entries, 1);",
      "revId": "2404146dabe68037df4ae86aa4e892fc1de4b3a0",
